<section class="relative min-h-[56vh] pt-12 pb-24 lg:pt-20 overflow-x-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367853/eurocert/w1.webp.webp" alt="Water audit team inspecting industrial water pipelines" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(3,16,34,0.86)_0%,rgba(10,36,99,0.78)_52%,rgba(14,116,144,0.72)_100%)]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.18),transparent_55%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.08] mb-5 tracking-tight">Comprehensive Water Audit Services for Industrial &amp; Commercial Facilities</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-5">Gain complete visibility into your water consumption, identify hidden losses, and implement data-driven strategies to reduce costs, improve operational efficiency, and achieve sustainable water management.</p><p class="text-white/80 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-8">Our engineering-led audits combine on-site inspection, advanced diagnostics, and detailed analysis to deliver measurable savings and long-term performance improvements.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4"><button type="button" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-5 bg-eurogold-400 text-[#031022] rounded-2xl heading-font font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-colors">Request Water Audit</button><a class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-5 border-2 border-white/20 text-white rounded-2xl heading-font font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors" href="/contact/">Schedule a Consultation</a></div></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-2 sm:p-3 shadow-2xl shadow-black/30"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367857/eurocert/w2.webp.webp" alt="Industrial water pipeline network for water audit systems" class="w-full h-full max-h-[430px] object-cover rounded-2xl" decoding="async" loading="eager"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-[#031022]">What is a Water Audit?</h2><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">A Water Audit is a detailed and systematic assessment of water flow across a facility. It involves tracking water from its point of entry through distribution networks, consumption points, and eventual discharge or reuse.</p><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">The purpose of the audit is to establish a complete water balance, which helps in identifying discrepancies between water input and actual usage. These discrepancies often indicate losses due to leakages, inefficiencies, or operational gaps.</p><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Unlike basic inspections, a professional water audit combines data analysis, field measurements, and system evaluation to provide a clear and accurate understanding of water usage patterns and performance.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-3 shadow-sm"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1780722003/AQMC_cESdhn2ZFMXkjWq8GsgLXh6uIQWnmcUa-pm4Xvq0XuHIXq9OA1i0mockpUAx1EQkjk1Hjq_HaKgee7YiqagMKhBz16xbrir7vSTqpGzS-EPyBWiEADgcOjiDbQ-n0DbM6njkjAbos8x3MJilKcIskl1KQ.jpeg_yeja0w.jpg" alt="Water audit image placeholder showing industrial water system" class="w-full h-full max-h-[430px] object-cover rounded-2xl" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 bg-[#030a16] text-white overflow-hidden"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.14),transparent_55%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-10">Why Water Audit is Important</h2><div class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-eurogold-400 bg-[#030a16] p-2 shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(212,168,67,0.35),0_18px_50px_rgba(212,168,67,0.25)] mb-10"><video class="w-full h-[260px] sm:h-[380px] md:h-[480px] lg:h-[560px] object-cover rounded-2xl" src="/w4.mp4" autoPlay="" loop="" muted="" playsInline="" controls="" preload="metadata"></video></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1628] p-8 shadow-[0_24px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Helps identify hidden water losses such as leakages, overflows, and inefficient usage.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Provides clear visibility into water consumption patterns across the facility.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Enables organizations to reduce water consumption and lower utility costs.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Improves operational efficiency by optimizing water usage in processes and systems.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Reduces energy consumption associated with water pumping, heating, and treatment.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Supports sustainability initiatives by minimizing water wastage and environmental impact.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Ensures compliance with regulatory requirements and environmental standards.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Helps in early detection of system issues, preventing major failures and costly repairs.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Enhances resource planning and long-term water management strategies.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/20 text-eurogold-300"><i class="fas fa-check text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-[15px]">Strengthens the organization's commitment to responsible and sustainable operations.</p></article></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><h2 class="heading-font text-center text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-14">Our Water Audit Methodology</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7"><i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar text-eurogold-500 text-2xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-3">Preliminary assessment and data review</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Review water bills, historical records, and operating logs to establish baseline consumption and identify irregular patterns.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7"><i class="fas fa-diagram-project text-eurogold-500 text-2xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-3">Water flow mapping and balance development</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Map the full network from source to discharge and build a complete water balance to identify unaccounted losses.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7"><i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass-location text-eurogold-500 text-2xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-3">Site inspection and system evaluation</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Inspect storage tanks, pumps, valves, pipelines, and end-use points to locate operational and infrastructure gaps.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7"><i class="fas fa-gauge-high text-eurogold-500 text-2xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-3">Measurement and diagnostic analysis</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Measure flow, pressure, and process performance, including hidden leak detection using engineering diagnostics.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7"><i class="fas fa-droplet text-eurogold-500 text-2xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-3">Performance analysis and conservation opportunities</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Analyze high-consumption areas and recommend practical water-saving opportunities with feasibility and ROI focus.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-eurogold-500 text-2xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-[#031022] mb-3">Reporting and implementation plan</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Deliver a detailed report with losses, recommendations, priorities, and a clear action roadmap.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-slate-50"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 xl:gap-10"><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-sm"><p class="heading-font text-eurogold-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-3">Coverage</p><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-5 text-[#031022]">Scope of Water Audit</h2><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">Our assessment covers the full lifecycle of water within your facility so no loss point is overlooked.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Water sources (municipal, borewell, recycled systems)</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Storage, pumping, and distribution infrastructure</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Process, utility, and domestic consumption points</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Wastewater generation and treatment systems</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Water recycling and reuse opportunities</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Monitoring and control mechanisms</span></div></div></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-sm"><p class="heading-font text-eurogold-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-3">Outcomes</p><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-5 text-[#031022]">Key Benefits</h2><div class="space-y-3"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-droplet mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Reduce overall water consumption and utility cost</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-droplet mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Identify hidden leakages and prevent avoidable losses</span></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fas fa-droplet mt-1 text-eurogold-500" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Improve system reliability and operational efficiency</span></div><div class="rounde